# Portfolio First

Primary question for every change: **Will this increase interview contact probability?**

## Priority order
1. Portfolio (this repo's React app)
2. CV (`inputs/`)
3. LinkedIn (`knowledge/linkedin-profile.md`)
4. Interview prep

## Audit triggers
On any repo change, review: content, structure, UX, credibility, technical depth, SEO, consistency.

## Flag proactively
- Missing sections (Contact, Experience in nav)
- Placeholder text, broken links, JS bugs
- Unverifiable claims (check `knowledge/profile-summary.md`)
- Weak project descriptions, missing impact
- Misleading UI (github icon → live demo URL)

## Roles
Senior SWE, Engineering Manager, Technical Recruiter, UX Reviewer

## Documentation
Log audits in `knowledge/portfolio-audit.md`. Update after meaningful changes.
